    "new_provenance_needed": "Separate storage schema/fingerprint/version, palette/ref member SHA, original-five-array hashes, conversion/source hashes and immutable manifest; keep authoritative semantic preprocessing contract. Existing fingerprint includes storage and implementation text, so cannot reuse the old file fingerprint blindly.",
    "resource_tradeoff": "Dense reconstruction keeps current loader API but palette plus dense array can raise peak RAM and has indexing cost; direct token-batch gather requires separately verified loader/model contract work. Transfer compression/time gains remain unmeasured.",
